The backend (Go) is derived from PufferPanel. The following packages
contain files modified from their original PufferPanel versions:

  internal/config, internal/connections, internal/database, internal/email,
  internal/groups, internal/logging, internal/middleware, internal/models,
  internal/oauth2, internal/operations, internal/query, internal/response,
  internal/scopes, internal/servers, internal/services, internal/sftp,
  internal/sys, internal/utils, internal/web

Changes made from the original PufferPanel source include, but are not
limited to:

  - Rebranding from "PufferPanel" to "SkyPanel" / "Aether Panel"
  - Renaming of environment variable prefix (PUFFER_ to SKYPANEL_)
  - Renaming of the authentication cookie (puffer_auth to skypanel_auth)
  - Replacing upstream runtime images with custom images published under
    ghcr.io/aether-panel/*
  - Replacing the frontend (originally Vue 3) with an original frontend
    written from scratch using Astro and React
  - Addition of new features and endpoints not present upstream
  - Various bug fixes and security hardening

The frontend (client/frontend), the Dockerfiles under docker/runtime-images,
and any other files that do not state otherwise are original works of
